WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.851
Describe examples of God’s promises and ways believers respond to a call.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.754
The curriculum uses stories of Abraham (Ibrahim) and Moses (Musa) when discussing

00:00:10.754 --> 00:00:15.807
God’s promises and call. Believers learn about trust, obedience, humility and service

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:17.071
from these stories.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:22.803
Responses may include prayer, helping people in need and caring for the environment.

00:00:22.803 --> 00:00:26.910
People of different faiths may explain these promises in different ways.

00:00:27.783 --> 00:00:33.543
Retell one story of Abraham/Ibrahim or Moses/Musa respectfully using a trusted text

00:00:33.543 --> 00:00:35.463
or a teacher’s summary.
